<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Full-text feed fixture for the integration path that matters most in production:
  a Chinese daily brief citing a mix of Chinese and English sources whose *pages* the
  picker cannot read (JS-rendered body, bot wall), while the feed response already
  carried the article's own illustrations plus their captions.

  Every image URL is on the same host as its item link, so an image selected for a
  section can be traced back to the source that section cites. Captions on the Chinese
  item are Chinese: that is the whole point of the caption channel, and no amount of
  substring matching against an English URL could ever replace it.

  Deliberately included nuisance content, all of which must be rejected:
    - a 1x1 pixel.wp.com beacon
    - an ads.example.com banner
    - an avatar (blocklist keyword)
    - a share card under /social-thumbnails/
-->
<rss version="2.0"
     xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"
     xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">
  <channel>
    <title>Mixed full-text feed</title>
    <link>https://example.com/</link>
    <description>fixture</description>

    <item>
      <title>Mainframes and Main Characters</title>
      <link>https://stratechery.com/2026/mainframes-and-main-characters/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://stratechery.com/2026/mainframes-and-main-characters/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Ben Thompson</dc:creator>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[
        <p>IBM's mainframe business is a useful lens on what OpenAI is building.</p>
        <figure class="wp-block-image">
          <img src="https://i0.wp.com/stratechery.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/inference-cost-per-million-tokens.png?resize=1330%2C564&#038;ssl=1"
               width="1330" height="564" alt="Inference cost per million tokens, 2023-2026" />
          <figcaption>推理成本随芯片代际下降的曲线，纵轴为每百万 token 的美元成本。</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p>The economics of packaging and yield are what actually gate the next generation.</p>
        <figure class="wp-block-image">
          <img src="https://i0.wp.com/stratechery.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/packaging-yield-curve.png?resize=1200%2C700&#038;ssl=1"
               width="1200" height="700" alt="Advanced packaging yield curve" />
          <figcaption>先进封装材料的良率与晶圆成本曲线，横轴为量产季度。</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p><img src="https://pixel.wp.com/b.gif?v=noscript" width="1" height="1" alt="" /></p>
        <p><img src="https://ads.example.com/banner-1456x180.jpg" width="1456" height="180" alt="advert" /></p>
      ]]></content:encoded>
    </item>

    <item>
      <title>少数派效率工具评测：本地推理这一年</title>
      <link>https://sspai.com/post/112425</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://sspai.com/post/112425</guid>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[
        <p>过去一年，本地推理从玩具变成了日常工具链的一部分。</p>
        <figure>
          <img src="https://rssfile.sspai.com/17/07/2026/article/local-inference-throughput.jpeg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/"
               width="1280" height="720" alt="local inference throughput" />
          <figcaption>不同量化精度下本地推理的吞吐对比，测试机为 32GB 内存的桌面平台。</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p>但真正的约束不在模型，而在材料与散热。</p>
        <figure>
          <img src="https://rssfile.sspai.com/17/07/2026/article/thermal-throttle.jpeg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/"
               width="1200" height="675" alt="thermal throttling" />
          <figcaption>长时间推理下的降频曲线，说明材料瓶颈如何变成实际的算力上限。</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p><img src="https://cdn.sspai.com/avatar/author-112425.png" width="96" height="96" alt="作者头像" /></p>
        <p><img src="https://cdn-thumbnails.example.com/social-thumbnails/blog/sspai/112425.png" width="1200" height="630" alt="share card" /></p>
      ]]></content:encoded>
    </item>
  </channel>
</rss>
